MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_001: Ugh. You know what, Cai? You got it good.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_002: What makes you say that, Goliath? Something on\nyour mind?
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_003: Ya got friends fallin' outta your ears! Kinda makes\nme jealous.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_004: For me, it's hard making friends.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_005: Really? Goliath the Butcher has trouble making\nfriends? You're famous!
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_006: I'm famous, sure—for being scary! That doesn't make\nyou friends!
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_007: I'm not like my big bro. Everyone thinks I'm a\nbad guy, so they stay away.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_008: It's just a matter of selling your friendly qualities. \nLet's put our heads together and figure this out.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_009: You think we can do that?
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_010: I'm into it, but—how? Drawing a big fat blank here.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_011: We need to think of a good place to start.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_012: One time, Nasshim's Circus came to my village.\nEveryone was excited to see 'em.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_013: Maybe you can try putting on a performance that\nmakes people happy.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_014: Huh! Yeah! Good thinking, little dude!
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_015: Only thing is, I'm not much of a performer. Mostly\nall I know's fighting.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_016: What would the circus troupe do with that? There's\ngotta be something we can use.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_017: Gymnastics on the back of a flying pegasus maybe.\nYou could try juggling me, and Peter, and Tialla.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_018: Huh. Well, one time I wrestled a runaway horse to\nthe ground...
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_019: That's it. We'll focus on the Butcher's strength.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_020: Alright! I think we're on the same page. Just uh...\nyou tell me, so I can be sure.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_021: You'll lift a huge rock and toss it really far.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_022: That's just what I was gonna say! Uh... Might hit\nsomeone though.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_023: And I'll run out and catch it. Pop taught me how to\ndo that.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_024: Shoulda figured! You are the guy who took me down,\nafter all.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_025: How's about we practice? We'll take turns throwin'\nand catchin'. Oughta be fun!
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_026: Yeah! That'll give us a huge pile of rocks.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_027: And when we're all done, you can lift 'em all at once.\nThis is gonna be great.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_028: Right! Let's get the biggest rocks we can find.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_029: You know how to keep the good ideas coming. You're\nlike a geyser. Of thoughts!
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_C_030: Thanks, Goliath! This is gonna make you really\npopular. No question.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_001: So...I don't think the people started liking me yet.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_002: It's not for lack of trying. I really thought that\nrock-throwing routine would work. It was so cool.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_003: The audience should have loved it. But they all just\nran away.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_004: And I was sure we'd get 'em when I lifted the\nkusarik over my head!
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_005: Yeah, that was a good overhead press. Maybe if you\nend the show by smashing a rock with your fist...
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_006: When I kept hitting you with a club—no one liked\nthat. At all.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_007: We both looked kinda nervous. Feel like that\nmight've turned folks off.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_008: I just don't get it! We tried so many things, and they\nALL went wrong!
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_009: Yeah...
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_010: Hrmm...
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_011: Goliath...do you think we overdid it?
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_012: Maybe you showing off your strength is more scary\nthan fun.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_013: Huh. If you're sayin' it, I believe it.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_014: But if I can't get people to like me with my strength,\nwhat else do I got? Nothing!
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_015: Maybe I'm not cut out to make friends.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_016: Don't say that.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_017: You've got great qualities. It's not your fault that no\none's noticed them yet.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_018: Aw, Cai. You don't gotta lie to make me feel better.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_019: Truth is, it was kinda fun spending time together\nfiguring this out.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_020: Hehehe. Don't get all mushy on me now.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_021: I'm serious! Who cares if those other losers don't\nlike me? I got you.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_022: Goliath... I just realized...
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_023: What is it, sprout? Got another idea?
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_024: You and me? We're friends now.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_025: Huh... Yeah! I guess we are!
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_026: We're buds! Pals! I had somebody in my corner from\nthe get-go, and I didn't realize it.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_027: Hahaha! I have a feeling we're gonna be friends for a\nlong, long time.
MID_SE_Kai_Gol_B_028: You got it, friend! Bwahaha! It feels good to say that!